            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Signet Jewelers CEO talks lab-grown vs. natural diamonds",
            "description": "<p><a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/lab-grown-diamond-market-reach-093200688.html\">Lab-grown diamonds have become more popular</a>, especially with younger consumers.</p>\n<p>J.K. Symancyk, CEO of Signet Jewelers (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SIG\">SIG</a>) (Kay Jewelers and Zales' parent company), joins Market Catalysts host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> and Yahoo Finance Executive Editor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/brian-sozzi/\">Brian Sozzi</a> to discuss the growing trend and how the company is addressing customers seeking both lab-grown and natural options.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
